Background
D-1

This page provides details about negotiating payment of outstanding tax liability including:

information on payment in full and payment plans
how to prepare for organising a payment plan for a taxpayer
frequently asked payment questions
how to collect financial information and make a decision.
Payment in full should always be discussed as an option before setting up a payment plan.

Navigating payment plans
Use the Negotiating Payment OptionsOpens in a new window to discuss payment options with the taxpayer and enter a payment plan.

