Scenarios
Create a payment plan online
Taxpayers can create payment plans via self-serve options:

individuals and sole traders - Online servicesOpens in a new window
businesses - Online services for businessOpens in a new window
registered agents - Online services for agentsOpens in a new window
ATO online payment plan estimator.Opens in a new window
The taxpayer will not meet the eligibility criteria to make a payment plan online if:

the account has
a debt less than $1 or greater than $200,000
an active legal action account
one or more of the following active legal action accounting treatments, judgment accounting treatments, or suppressions
