Release authorities
For release authorities issued from 1 July 2018, a superannuation provider must send the Release Authority Statement (RAS) to the ATO within 10 business days. This timeframe starts on the day that the release authority is issued and ends when the RAS is sent to the ATO.

To confirm the amount the taxpayer has elected to have released by their super fund, check for ECC, ENCC and Division 293 related release authorities. Refer to heading Determine if an election has been received and processed and follow steps 1 to 3 in the Release Authority Issues and Payment not received for ECC, ENCC or Div293 electionOpens in a new window procedure.

