Once the taxpayer has provided the requested financials statements, review them with the information obtained during your review of the taxpayer. This includes information from ATO systems, ECP and external resources, where appropriate.

By analysing the taxpayer's financial statements along with their profile, you can use it to:

highlight areas of potential risk that may require further consideration
determine if the taxpayer has the capacity to pay.
