Decision
Determine if the deferral request meets the criteria.

Narrate your decision:

include what you are recommending and/or approving
ensure the reasons for your decision are appropriately detailed. Include the following
lodgment and payment history of the entity and the economic group
specific impacts that have been provided
evidence.
