Information alert:Payment deferrals are generally a short-term measure to provide immediate assistance in extenuating circumstances.

If payment is unlikely to be made in full by the deferred due date:

a sustainable P/A may be more appropriate, or
consider a suspension of action to stop further recovery action from continuing or being considered.
