Payment by credit or debit card
What to advise the taxpayer when they want to pay via credit/debit card and how to process.

Last published 17 December 2025

Favourite Notes Collapse all 
Background
This page provides information for taxpayers on payments by credit or debit card and how to process the payment.

Do not take credit card details until after call recording is paused as instructed in this procedure.

If the taxpayer has made multiple unsuccessful payment attempts using their credit or debit card, for the same Payment Reference Number (PRN), advise them to try again the next day. Do not raise a Payment Enquiry or Missing Payment escalation.


